#Commands
command.nutrition:usage=Nutrition commands: help, get, set, add, subtract, reset, reload
command.nutrition:help.1=Nutrition Help Page:
command.nutrition:help.2=/nutrition get <player> [nutrient] - List a player's nutrients, optionally specifying a specific nutrient.
command.nutrition:help.3=/nutrition set <player> <nutrient> <value> - Set a player's nutrient value.
command.nutrition:help.4=/nutrition add <player> <nutrient> <value> - Add to a player's nutrient value.
command.nutrition:help.5=/nutrition subtract <player> <nutrient> <value> - Remove from a player's nutrient value.
command.nutrition:help.6=/nutrition reset <player> [nutrient] - Reset a player's nutrients, optionally specifying a specific nutrient.
command.nutrition:help.7=/nutrition reload - Reload nutrients and potion effects from config data.
